[
  {
    "start": 14.0,
    "end": 14.654,
    "text": "Welcome."
  },
  {
    "start": 21.154,
    "end": 23.043,
    "text": "This is a longer practice."
  },
  {
    "start": 29.543,
    "end": 30.983,
    "text": "A full reset."
  },
  {
    "start": 37.483,
    "end": 41.988,
    "text": "A chance to put down the person you've been, for a little while."
  },
  {
    "start": 48.488,
    "end": 50.485,
    "text": "And meet the one you're becoming."
  },
  {
    "start": 56.985,
    "end": 62.558,
    "text": "Find a position where your body can be still, sitting or lying down."
  },
  {
    "start": 69.058,
    "end": 71.844,
    "text": "Let your hands rest somewhere easy."
  },
  {
    "start": 78.344,
    "end": 82.431,
    "text": "Let your feet feel the ground, or the surface beneath you."
  },
  {
    "start": 88.931,
    "end": 92.228,
    "text": "And when you're ready, let your eyes close."
  },
  {
    "start": 98.728,
    "end": 101.096,
    "text": "Take a breath in, all the way down."
  },
  {
    "start": 111.096,
    "end": 112.628,
    "text": "And a slow release."
  },
  {
    "start": 119.128,
    "end": 120.02,
    "text": "Another."
  },
  {
    "start": 122.42,
    "end": 125.943,
    "text": "Breathing in, drawing your attention inward."
  },
  {
    "start": 132.443,
    "end": 137.735,
    "text": "Breathing out, letting go of everything you walked in here carrying."
  },
  {
    "start": 144.235,
    "end": 145.21,
    "text": "One more."
  },
  {
    "start": 147.61,
    "end": 149.7,
    "text": "A full, unhurried breath."
  },
  {
    "start": 156.2,
    "end": 158.849,
    "text": "And a longer, slower exhale."
  },
  {
    "start": 168.849,
    "end": 169.685,
    "text": "Good."
  },
  {
    "start": 176.185,
    "end": 179.389,
    "text": "Now let the breath return to its natural rhythm."
  },
  {
    "start": 185.889,
    "end": 187.381,
    "text": "You've done your part."
  },
  {
    "start": 193.881,
    "end": 196.064,
    "text": "Your body will take it from here."
  },
  {
    "start": 202.564,
    "end": 205.583,
    "text": "Let your attention rest inside your body."
  },
  {
    "start": 212.083,
    "end": 214.08,
    "text": "Notice the weight of you."
  },
  {
    "start": 216.48,
    "end": 218.982,
    "text": "The places where you meet the ground."
  },
  {
    "start": 225.482,
    "end": 226.782,
    "text": "Feel your feet."
  },
  {
    "start": 229.182,
    "end": 230.358,
    "text": "Your legs."
  },
  {
    "start": 232.758,
    "end": 234.291,
    "text": "The seat of your hips."
  },
  {
    "start": 240.791,
    "end": 242.927,
    "text": "Feel the length of your spine."
  },
  {
    "start": 245.327,
    "end": 246.696,
    "text": "Long and easy."
  },
  {
    "start": 249.096,
    "end": 251.186,
    "text": "Supporting you without effort."
  },
  {
    "start": 257.686,
    "end": 260.983,
    "text": "Feel your shoulders, softening downward."
  },
  {
    "start": 263.383,
    "end": 265.789,
    "text": "Your arms, heavy and warm."
  },
  {
    "start": 268.189,
    "end": 269.789,
    "text": "Your hands, open."
  },
  {
    "start": 276.289,
    "end": 279.075,
    "text": "Feel your chest rising and falling."
  },
  {
    "start": 281.475,
    "end": 283.286,
    "text": "Your throat, soft."
  },
  {
    "start": 285.686,
    "end": 288.032,
    "text": "Your face, gently relaxed."
  },
  {
    "start": 294.532,
    "end": 297.922,
    "text": "The space between your eyebrows, opening."
  },
  {
    "start": 300.322,
    "end": 302.953,
    "text": "The top of your head, receiving."
  },
  {
    "start": 309.453,
    "end": 310.614,
    "text": "You're here."
  },
  {
    "start": 313.014,
    "end": 314.175,
    "text": "Fully here."
  },
  {
    "start": 316.575,
    "end": 318.851,
    "text": "And you can let everything else wait."
  },
  {
    "start": 328.851,
    "end": 330.662,
    "text": "I want you to do something now."
  },
  {
    "start": 333.062,
    "end": 334.362,
    "text": "Something simple."
  },
  {
    "start": 336.762,
    "end": 337.969,
    "text": "But important."
  },
  {
    "start": 344.469,
    "end": 348.416,
    "text": "I want you to imagine setting down the person you've been today."
  },
  {
    "start": 354.916,
    "end": 356.959,
    "text": "All the roles you've played."
  },
  {
    "start": 359.359,
    "end": 360.984,
    "text": "The work self."
  },
  {
    "start": 363.384,
    "end": 364.963,
    "text": "The parent self."
  },
  {
    "start": 367.363,
    "end": 368.942,
    "text": "The partner self."
  },
  {
    "start": 371.342,
    "end": 375.422,
    "text": "The self that was worried, or rushing, or performing."
  },
  {
    "start": 381.922,
    "end": 383.129,
    "text": "Set it down."
  },
  {
    "start": 385.529,
    "end": 388.269,
    "text": "Place it gently on the ground beside you."
  },
  {
    "start": 390.669,
    "end": 393.455,
    "text": "You can pick it up again later, if you want to."
  },
  {
    "start": 399.955,
    "end": 403.236,
    "text": "But for now, you don't have to be anyone."
  },
  {
    "start": 409.736,
    "end": 411.269,
    "text": "Take another breath."
  },
  {
    "start": 413.669,
    "end": 418.499,
    "text": "And as you exhale, let more of that identity fall away."
  },
  {
    "start": 424.999,
    "end": 427.6,
    "text": "The stories about what you should be doing."
  },
  {
    "start": 430.0,
    "end": 432.74,
    "text": "The stories about what you haven't done yet."
  },
  {
    "start": 435.14,
    "end": 438.437,
    "text": "The stories about who you are and who you're not."
  },
  {
    "start": 444.937,
    "end": 446.238,
    "text": "Let them rest."
  },
  {
    "start": 448.638,
    "end": 450.31,
    "text": "Without you telling them."
  },
  {
    "start": 456.81,
    "end": 459.782,
    "text": "Notice what remains when the story stops."
  },
  {
    "start": 469.782,
    "end": 471.315,
    "text": "Pure awareness."
  },
  {
    "start": 473.715,
    "end": 474.69,
    "text": "Quiet."
  },
  {
    "start": 477.09,
    "end": 478.108,
    "text": "Present."
  },
  {
    "start": 480.508,
    "end": 481.416,
    "text": "Alive."
  },
  {
    "start": 487.916,
    "end": 489.62,
    "text": "This is the real you."
  },
  {
    "start": 492.02,
    "end": 493.778,
    "text": "Before all the layers."
  },
  {
    "start": 496.178,
    "end": 497.774,
    "text": "Before all the roles."
  },
  {
    "start": 504.274,
    "end": 507.571,
    "text": "This is the part of you that's been watching all along."
  },
  {
    "start": 509.971,
    "end": 511.782,
    "text": "The part that doesn't age."
  },
  {
    "start": 514.182,
    "end": 517.293,
    "text": "The part that's been here since you were a child,"
  },
  {
    "start": 519.693,
    "end": 522.34,
    "text": "and will be here until your last breath."
  },
  {
    "start": 528.84,
    "end": 530.044,
    "text": "This is home."
  },
  {
    "start": 540.044,
    "end": 546.174,
    "text": "Now, from this quiet place, let the edges of your body begin to soften."
  },
  {
    "start": 552.674,
    "end": 554.507,
    "text": "Imagine them dissolving."
  },
  {
    "start": 556.907,
    "end": 558.341,
    "text": "Not disappearing."
  },
  {
    "start": 560.741,
    "end": 562.041,
    "text": "Expanding."
  },
  {
    "start": 568.541,
    "end": 571.56,
    "text": "Your body becoming less like an object."
  },
  {
    "start": 573.96,
    "end": 575.478,
    "text": "More like a field."
  },
  {
    "start": 577.878,
    "end": 580.757,
    "text": "A cloud of soft, awake energy."
  },
  {
    "start": 587.257,
    "end": 590.508,
    "text": "The space around you feels closer now."
  },
  {
    "start": 592.908,
    "end": 594.719,
    "text": "You can sense the air."
  },
  {
    "start": 597.119,
    "end": 598.234,
    "text": "The room."
  },
  {
    "start": 600.634,
    "end": 603.221,
    "text": "And beyond the room, something wider."
  },
  {
    "start": 609.721,
    "end": 614.551,
    "text": "Imagine you're floating in a vast, soft field of light."
  },
  {
    "start": 616.951,
    "end": 617.965,
    "text": "Not bright."
  },
  {
    "start": 620.365,
    "end": 621.27,
    "text": "Warm."
  },
  {
    "start": 623.67,
    "end": 626.224,
    "text": "Like a dusk sky full of stars."
  },
  {
    "start": 632.724,
    "end": 635.139,
    "text": "In every direction, possibility."
  },
  {
    "start": 637.539,
    "end": 639.236,
    "text": "Every life you could live."
  },
  {
    "start": 641.636,
    "end": 646.977,
    "text": "Every version of yourself that could exist."
  },
  {
    "start": 649.377,
    "end": 650.563,
    "text": "All of it here."
  },
  {
    "start": 652.963,
    "end": 654.269,
    "text": "All of it real."
  },
  {
    "start": 660.769,
    "end": 662.905,
    "text": "You've been living in one version."
  },
  {
    "start": 665.305,
    "end": 666.838,
    "text": "But that was a choice."
  },
  {
    "start": 669.238,
    "end": 671.071,
    "text": "Made by a younger you."
  },
  {
    "start": 673.471,
    "end": 674.818,
    "text": "A while back."
  },
  {
    "start": 681.318,
    "end": 683.906,
    "text": "And tonight, you can make a new one."
  },
  {
    "start": 693.906,
    "end": 700.5,
    "text": "Let your attention drift, gently, toward a point of light in the field."
  },
  {
    "start": 707.0,
    "end": 708.436,
    "text": "Somewhere ahead of you."
  },
  {
    "start": 710.836,
    "end": 712.833,
    "text": "A little brighter than the others."
  },
  {
    "start": 715.233,
    "end": 716.1,
    "text": "Warmer."
  },
  {
    "start": 722.6,
    "end": 725.851,
    "text": "This is the version of you that you're becoming."
  },
  {
    "start": 732.351,
    "end": 736.438,
    "text": "The version that has already released the old fears."
  },
  {
    "start": 738.838,
    "end": 741.346,
    "text": "The version that trusts themselves."
  },
  {
    "start": 743.746,
    "end": 746.014,
    "text": "The version that follows through."
  },
  {
    "start": 748.414,
    "end": 751.148,
    "text": "The version that lives in abundance."
  },
  {
    "start": 753.548,
    "end": 757.177,
    "text": "The version that loves freely and receives easily."
  },
  {
    "start": 763.677,
    "end": 764.556,
    "text": "See them."
  },
  {
    "start": 774.556,
    "end": 776.785,
    "text": "Notice how they carry themselves."
  },
  {
    "start": 779.185,
    "end": 781.228,
    "text": "The ease in their body."
  },
  {
    "start": 783.628,
    "end": 785.718,
    "text": "The steadiness in their gaze."
  },
  {
    "start": 788.118,
    "end": 790.247,
    "text": "The openness in their chest."
  },
  {
    "start": 796.747,
    "end": 798.28,
    "text": "Notice their face."
  },
  {
    "start": 800.68,
    "end": 802.77,
    "text": "Softer than yours has been."
  },
  {
    "start": 805.17,
    "end": 806.563,
    "text": "More at peace."
  },
  {
    "start": 808.963,
    "end": 810.217,
    "text": "More alive."
  },
  {
    "start": 816.717,
    "end": 818.435,
    "text": "This is not a fantasy."
  },
  {
    "start": 820.835,
    "end": 823.343,
    "text": "This is a real version of you."
  },
  {
    "start": 825.743,
    "end": 827.415,
    "text": "Existing in the field."
  },
  {
    "start": 829.815,
    "end": 830.837,
    "text": "Already."
  },
  {
    "start": 837.337,
    "end": 839.845,
    "text": "And tonight, you can step into them."
  },
  {
    "start": 846.345,
    "end": 848.017,
    "text": "Take a slow breath in."
  },
  {
    "start": 854.517,
    "end": 859.486,
    "text": "As you exhale, feel yourself moving toward that point of light."
  },
  {
    "start": 865.986,
    "end": 867.481,
    "text": "Another breath in."
  },
  {
    "start": 871.081,
    "end": 872.474,
    "text": "Moving closer."
  },
  {
    "start": 878.974,
    "end": 879.949,
    "text": "One more."
  },
  {
    "start": 882.349,
    "end": 883.603,
    "text": "And you arrive."
  },
  {
    "start": 890.103,
    "end": 893.029,
    "text": "Feel your awareness merging with theirs."
  },
  {
    "start": 899.529,
    "end": 901.944,
    "text": "Their body becoming your body."
  },
  {
    "start": 904.344,
    "end": 908.18,
    "text": "Their nervous system becoming your nervous system."
  },
  {
    "start": 910.58,
    "end": 912.856,
    "text": "Their peace becoming yours."
  },
  {
    "start": 915.256,
    "end": 917.664,
    "text": "Their certainty becoming yours."
  },
  {
    "start": 924.164,
    "end": 926.068,
    "text": "Notice what this feels like."
  },
  {
    "start": 936.068,
    "end": 937.786,
    "text": "The quality of the breath."
  },
  {
    "start": 940.186,
    "end": 942.26,
    "text": "The openness in the chest."
  },
  {
    "start": 944.66,
    "end": 946.461,
    "text": "The warmth in the hands."
  },
  {
    "start": 948.861,
    "end": 951.09,
    "text": "The softness behind the eyes."
  },
  {
    "start": 953.49,
    "end": 956.409,
    "text": "The quiet hum of being home in yourself."
  },
  {
    "start": 966.409,
    "end": 967.384,
    "text": "Stay here."
  },
  {
    "start": 969.784,
    "end": 971.502,
    "text": "Let the feeling spread."
  },
  {
    "start": 981.502,
    "end": 984.345,
    "text": "Breathing in, let this new state deepen."
  },
  {
    "start": 990.845,
    "end": 996.0,
    "text": "Breathing out, let any remnant of the old self continue to release."
  },
  {
    "start": 1002.5,
    "end": 1005.333,
    "text": "Your body is learning this frequency."
  },
  {
    "start": 1007.733,
    "end": 1009.776,
    "text": "Your cells are remembering."
  },
  {
    "start": 1012.176,
    "end": 1016.402,
    "text": "Every moment you stay here, it becomes more yours."
  },
  {
    "start": 1026.402,
    "end": 1029.049,
    "text": "Now let a soft golden light begin"
  },
  {
    "start": 1031.449,
    "end": 1033.615,
    "text": "to gather at the top of your head."
  },
  {
    "start": 1040.115,
    "end": 1042.483,
    "text": "A warm, honey colored light."
  },
  {
    "start": 1044.883,
    "end": 1046.741,
    "text": "Gathering, slowly."
  },
  {
    "start": 1053.241,
    "end": 1058.582,
    "text": "And as you inhale, this light begins to move down through you."
  },
  {
    "start": 1065.082,
    "end": 1066.568,
    "text": "Into your forehead."
  },
  {
    "start": 1068.968,
    "end": 1070.406,
    "text": "Behind your eyes."
  },
  {
    "start": 1072.806,
    "end": 1075.221,
    "text": "Softening the muscles of your face."
  },
  {
    "start": 1077.621,
    "end": 1079.246,
    "text": "Down through your jaw."
  },
  {
    "start": 1081.646,
    "end": 1082.807,
    "text": "Your throat."
  },
  {
    "start": 1089.307,
    "end": 1092.558,
    "text": "Every place it touches, it rewrites."
  },
  {
    "start": 1094.958,
    "end": 1096.444,
    "text": "Any old patterns."
  },
  {
    "start": 1098.844,
    "end": 1100.098,
    "text": "Any tension."
  },
  {
    "start": 1102.498,
    "end": 1103.891,
    "text": "Any resistance."
  },
  {
    "start": 1106.291,
    "end": 1108.111,
    "text": "They dissolve in the warmth."
  },
  {
    "start": 1114.611,
    "end": 1116.29,
    "text": "Let it continue down."
  },
  {
    "start": 1118.69,
    "end": 1120.13,
    "text": "Into your chest."
  },
  {
    "start": 1122.53,
    "end": 1123.976,
    "text": "Filling your heart."
  },
  {
    "start": 1126.376,
    "end": 1127.975,
    "text": "Warming your lungs."
  },
  {
    "start": 1134.475,
    "end": 1137.87,
    "text": "Down your arms, into your hands."
  },
  {
    "start": 1140.27,
    "end": 1141.8,
    "text": "Into every finger."
  },
  {
    "start": 1148.3,
    "end": 1150.808,
    "text": "Down through the center of your body."
  },
  {
    "start": 1153.208,
    "end": 1154.437,
    "text": "Into your hips."
  },
  {
    "start": 1156.837,
    "end": 1158.044,
    "text": "Your thighs."
  },
  {
    "start": 1160.444,
    "end": 1161.68,
    "text": "Your knees."
  },
  {
    "start": 1164.08,
    "end": 1166.216,
    "text": "All the way down into your feet."
  },
  {
    "start": 1172.716,
    "end": 1175.41,
    "text": "Your whole body, lit from within."
  },
  {
    "start": 1177.81,
    "end": 1178.715,
    "text": "Warm."
  },
  {
    "start": 1181.115,
    "end": 1182.033,
    "text": "Calm."
  },
  {
    "start": 1184.433,
    "end": 1185.184,
    "text": "Full."
  },
  {
    "start": 1191.684,
    "end": 1193.495,
    "text": "This is the new baseline."
  },
  {
    "start": 1195.895,
    "end": 1199.053,
    "text": "This is the you that is coming forward now."
  },
  {
    "start": 1205.553,
    "end": 1207.172,
    "text": "I am becoming."
  },
  {
    "start": 1213.672,
    "end": 1214.972,
    "text": "I am trusted."
  },
  {
    "start": 1221.472,
    "end": 1223.655,
    "text": "I am home in my own body."
  },
  {
    "start": 1230.155,
    "end": 1232.663,
    "text": "I follow through on what matters."
  },
  {
    "start": 1239.163,
    "end": 1242.925,
    "text": "I am a channel for what wants to come through me."
  },
  {
    "start": 1249.425,
    "end": 1250.586,
    "text": "I receive."
  },
  {
    "start": 1252.986,
    "end": 1253.915,
    "text": "I give."
  },
  {
    "start": 1256.315,
    "end": 1257.225,
    "text": "I flow."
  },
  {
    "start": 1263.725,
    "end": 1266.457,
    "text": "The field is shifting to match me."
  },
  {
    "start": 1272.957,
    "end": 1275.558,
    "text": "The people I need are moving toward me."
  },
  {
    "start": 1282.058,
    "end": 1285.39,
    "text": "The opportunities I'm ready for are finding me."
  },
  {
    "start": 1291.89,
    "end": 1295.745,
    "text": "The money, the work, the love, the peace."
  },
  {
    "start": 1302.245,
    "end": 1304.428,
    "text": "All of it is already on the way."
  },
  {
    "start": 1314.428,
    "end": 1316.286,
    "text": "Stay in this for a while."
  },
  {
    "start": 1322.786,
    "end": 1324.226,
    "text": "Don't think about it."
  },
  {
    "start": 1326.626,
    "end": 1327.648,
    "text": "Feel it."
  },
  {
    "start": 1334.148,
    "end": 1336.981,
    "text": "Feel what it's like to be home in yourself."
  },
  {
    "start": 1339.381,
    "end": 1342.492,
    "text": "Feel what it's like to know that you are enough."
  },
  {
    "start": 1344.892,
    "end": 1347.835,
    "text": "Feel what it's like to trust the unfolding."
  },
  {
    "start": 1357.835,
    "end": 1360.157,
    "text": "Your nervous system is recording this."
  },
  {
    "start": 1362.557,
    "end": 1364.554,
    "text": "Your cells are taking notes."
  },
  {
    "start": 1366.954,
    "end": 1369.601,
    "text": "This is becoming your natural state."
  },
  {
    "start": 1379.601,
    "end": 1382.852,
    "text": "And when you return to your day, to your week,"
  },
  {
    "start": 1385.252,
    "end": 1389.432,
    "text": "to your life, this feeling will travel with you."
  },
  {
    "start": 1395.932,
    "end": 1398.208,
    "text": "You may not notice it at first."
  },
  {
    "start": 1400.608,
    "end": 1402.539,
    "text": "But something has changed."
  },
  {
    "start": 1404.939,
    "end": 1407.354,
    "text": "You'll feel it in your responses."
  },
  {
    "start": 1409.754,
    "end": 1411.426,
    "text": "In the choices you make."
  },
  {
    "start": 1413.826,
    "end": 1415.823,
    "text": "In what bothers you less."
  },
  {
    "start": 1418.223,
    "end": 1419.848,
    "text": "In what becomes easier."
  },
  {
    "start": 1426.348,
    "end": 1427.927,
    "text": "This is not magic."
  },
  {
    "start": 1430.327,
    "end": 1433.903,
    "text": "This is you, returning to who you already are."
  },
  {
    "start": 1440.403,
    "end": 1442.771,
    "text": "Rest in it for one more breath."
  },
  {
    "start": 1449.271,
    "end": 1452.93,
    "text": "Breathing in, gratitude for this version of you."
  },
  {
    "start": 1459.43,
    "end": 1462.634,
    "text": "Breathing out, sealing this in your body."
  },
  {
    "start": 1469.134,
    "end": 1472.617,
    "text": "Now slowly, gently, begin to return."
  },
  {
    "start": 1479.117,
    "end": 1481.346,
    "text": "Notice the sounds around you."
  },
  {
    "start": 1483.746,
    "end": 1486.95,
    "text": "The weight of your body against the surface."
  },
  {
    "start": 1489.35,
    "end": 1492.229,
    "text": "The temperature of the air on your skin."
  },
  {
    "start": 1498.729,
    "end": 1500.124,
    "text": "Move your fingers."
  },
  {
    "start": 1502.524,
    "end": 1503.546,
    "text": "Slowly."
  },
  {
    "start": 1505.946,
    "end": 1507.293,
    "text": "Your toes."
  },
  {
    "start": 1513.793,
    "end": 1515.326,
    "text": "Take a deep breath in."
  },
  {
    "start": 1518.926,
    "end": 1520.505,
    "text": "And a long release."
  },
  {
    "start": 1527.005,
    "end": 1530.952,
    "text": "Gently roll your head side to side, if that feels right."
  },
  {
    "start": 1533.352,
    "end": 1535.395,
    "text": "Stretch your arms overhead."
  },
  {
    "start": 1537.795,
    "end": 1540.674,
    "text": "Or whatever movement your body asks for."
  },
  {
    "start": 1547.174,
    "end": 1550.239,
    "text": "And when you're ready, let your eyes open."
  },
  {
    "start": 1556.739,
    "end": 1557.946,
    "text": "Take your time."
  },
  {
    "start": 1560.346,
    "end": 1561.879,
    "text": "There's no rush."
  },
  {
    "start": 1568.379,
    "end": 1570.562,
    "text": "Something in you is different now."
  },
  {
    "start": 1572.962,
    "end": 1574.727,
    "text": "You don't have to name it."
  },
  {
    "start": 1577.127,
    "end": 1578.752,
    "text": "Your body knows."
  },
  {
    "start": 1585.252,
    "end": 1587.806,
    "text": "The old version is already fading."
  },
  {
    "start": 1590.206,
    "end": 1592.76,
    "text": "The new one is already taking shape."
  },
  {
    "start": 1595.16,
    "end": 1598.504,
    "text": "The field is already rearranging to meet you."
  },
  {
    "start": 1605.004,
    "end": 1606.397,
    "text": "Carry this with you."
  },
  {
    "start": 1608.797,
    "end": 1609.958,
    "text": "Walk slow."
  },
  {
    "start": 1612.358,
    "end": 1613.612,
    "text": "Breathe deep."
  },
  {
    "start": 1616.012,
    "end": 1617.823,
    "text": "Trust the unfolding."
  },
  {
    "start": 1624.323,
    "end": 1626.041,
    "text": "The reset is complete."
  }
]
